          "contributor_id": "105404772383465188384",
          "description": "Great restaurant. Very friendly and helpful staff. Great value for money when compared to other Indian restaurants. This is my favorite restaurant and I visit it often after work or during weekends for takeout.\n\n10/10 would recommend.",
          "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0eE9ETlNUWE5JYkRCWmJWWlFhVTFGUW1neVJIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb645aa96f244570c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOktxODNSTXNIbDBZbVZQaU1FQmgyRHc%7C0d9h_bjF_gQ%7C?hl=en-US",
