          "username": "keith Howard",
          "rating": 5,
          "contributor_id": "113529815800836805781",
          "description": "Great food at a price you can't find anywhere else.\nI met the owner at HFC in Kasai and he is such a down to earth and friendly guy. I'm so happy to see they stick to their religious beliefs while running the restaurants.\nKeep it up guys!",
          "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOeVMzb3RaalJKZGsxTk5teGFibEkwVm10SWJtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb645aa96f244570c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNyS3otZjRJdk1NNmxablI0VmtIbmc%7C0d32HQRHWLJ%7C?hl=en-US",
