        {
          "username": "Trisha Tishu",
          "rating": 4,
          "contributor_id": "102444109363272964708",
          "description": "I found them by searching for Halal restaurants on Google Maps. basically I was coming to eat their barbecue. Ordered BBQ half plattrer, Lahori fish fry, mutton paya, habibi kheer and gulab jamun. They can speak good Hindi. They has 2 Bengali Indian chefs. They had a beautiful ambience. They served salad, we had naan with paya, in BBQ platter they included sheekh kebab, sami kebab, chicken tandoori, chicken tikka, malai tikka, chapli kebab.  BBQ platter and fish fry were delicious with chutney. I didn't like the mutton paya very much. Habibi kheer and gulab jamun were good. They had restroom and parking.",
